---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const title = 'Contact Us | JSON Diff Checker';
const description =
  'Get in touch with the JSON Diff Checker team for feedback, bug reports, or feature requests.';

const contactEmail = 'support@jsondiffchecker.com';
---

<PageLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  eyebrow="Contact us"
  heading="Contact Us"
>
  <p>
    We'd love to hear from you — whether it's a bug report, a feature request, or general feedback about
    JSON Diff Checker.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    The fastest way to reach us is by email at
    {' '}<a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. We generally respond within a few business days.
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting a bug</h2>
  <p>
    If you've found a bug, it helps to include the JSON you were comparing (or a minimal example that
    reproduces the issue), the browser and OS you're using, and a description of what you expected to
    happen versus what actually happened.
  </p>

  <h2>Feature requests</h2>
  <p>
    Have an idea for a feature that would make comparing JSON easier? Send it our way — we read every
    suggestion, even if we can't respond to or implement all of them.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
